  "shortDescription": "A crosshair following the mouse or touch, with spread when shooting, a hit marker and a color on targets.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": [
    "A crosshair (or a reticle) for shooters. Its position is its center: put it at the cursor, the center of the screen or anywhere without any offset.",
    "",
    "By default it follows the mouse cursor (or the touch) and hides the mouse cursor. Then, optionally:",
    "- **Add spread** when shooting: its arms move apart and come back by themselves (the \"Spread\" expression can make shots less precise),",
    "- **Show the hit marker** when a shot hits,",
    "- **On a target**: it takes another color while aiming at an enemy.",
    "",
    "Ready-to-use crosshairs are in the asset store [crosshairs pack](https://editor.gdevelop.io/?initial-dialog=asset-store&asset-pack=crosshairs-crosshairs)."
  ],
